    "explanation": "<p class=\"text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground\">A <strong>time series graph</strong> is a line graph that displays data points collected at regular intervals over a period of time. It helps us observe how values change day by day, month by month, or year by year. This type of graph is useful for showing patterns and trends in data over time.</p>",
